# English

## Features

- Rust 2024 workspace
- Reusable core library
- Command-line entry point
- Formatting, linting, testing, docs, and dependency checks
- GitHub Actions CI and an lcov coverage artifact

## Quick Start

```bash
cargo run -p {{package_name}}-cli -- --name Rust
```

## Project Structure

- `{{package_name}}-core`: reusable domain logic.
- `{{package_name}}-cli`: command-line entry point.

## Development

Run `just ci` to execute all local quality checks.

## Contributing

Create a feature branch, update tests, run `just ci`, and open a pull request.

